# Profile feature scope

Student identity, experience, achievements, profile shell.

## Primary touch zones (edit freely)
- `College/Features/Profile/**`

## Tests
- `CollegeTests/Features/Profile/**`

## Allowed shared touch
### Persistence (only when the task needs data writes)
- `College/Core/Data/Persistence/CollegePersistence+ProfileShell.swift`
### Repositories (only when the task needs data writes)
- `College/Core/Data/Repositories/ProfileRepository.swift`
